{"content":"The pass is closed until day 5 — it's day 1. Pushing at the rocks is wasted time. The productive move is to read the notice board (confirms schedule) and then farm the meadow soil until day 5, then walk the east corridor.","toolCalls":[{"id":"call_00_aNgJEbOF0i1Qq0ecVglc7410","name":"submit_plan","args":{"approach":"Rockslide Pass (11,4) is impassable until the repair crew clears it on the morning of day 5 (wiki + notice board); it's day 1, so instead of pushing rocks I'll read the notice board to confirm, then till/plant/water the meadow soil to pass the days, and finally walk the east corridor (x 11) north to the shrine chest at (11,1).","steps":[{"kind":"walk_to","x":4,"y":7,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"interact","x":3,"y":7,"button":"left"},{"kind":"wait","minutes":1},{"kind":"walk_to","x":5,"y":6,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"interact","x":5,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":1},{"kind":"walk_to","x":6,"y":6,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"interact","x":6,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":1},{"kind":"walk_to","x":7,"y":6,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"interact","x":7,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":1},{"kind":"walk_to","x":5,"y":6,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"interact","x":5,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":3},{"kind":"walk_to","x":6,"y":6,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"interact","x":6,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":3},{"kind":"walk_to","x":7,"y":6,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"interact","x":7,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":3},{"kind":"walk_to","x":5,"y":6,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"interact","x":5,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":2},{"kind":"walk_to","x":6,"y":6,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"interact","x":6,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":2},{"kind":"walk_to","x":7,"y":6,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"interact","x":7,"y":6,"button":"left","slot":2},{"kind":"wait","minutes":20},{"kind":"walk_to","x":11,"y":5,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"walk_to","x":11,"y":4,"mode":"walk"},{"kind":"walk_to","x":11,"y":1,"mode":"walk"}]}}],"ms":3167,"cached":false,"usage":{"prompt":2011,"completion":848}}